<p>However, there might be another rare circumstance, in which an interrupt occurs while adding an end-marker to the queue in <tt>AbstractAsyncThread</tt>'s <tt>initShutdown</tt>. This may lead to the same problem that the writer does not receive the end-marker and does not terminate. </p>

