<p>Fixed in <span class="error">&#91;/changeset/1806/kieker&#93;</span>:</p>

<p>Both ServletContextListeners can now be configured via <em>context-param_s in a web application's _web.xml</em> file, as detailed below.</p>

<h2><a name="CPUMemUsageServletContextListener"></a>CPUMemUsageServletContextListener</h2>

<p>Example usage:</p>


<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>&lt;web-app&gt;
 ...

 &lt;context-param&gt;
  &lt;param-name&gt;CPUMemUsageServletContextListener.samplingIntervalSeconds&lt;/param-name&gt;
  &lt;param-value&gt;15&lt;/param-value&gt;
 &lt;/context-param&gt;

 &lt;context-param&gt;
  &lt;param-name&gt;CPUMemUsageServletContextListener.initialSamplingDelaySeconds&lt;/param-name&gt;
  &lt;param-value&gt;0&lt;/param-value&gt;
 &lt;/context-param&gt;

 &lt;listener&gt;
   &lt;listener-class&gt;
    kieker.monitoring.probe.servlet.CPUMemUsageServletContextListener
   &lt;/listener-class&gt;
 &lt;/listener&gt;

... 
&lt;/web-app&gt;
</pre>
</div></div>

