<p>The following code is used to perform the parsing:</p>
<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>public static final String convertToPath(final String path) {
	try {
		return new URI(null, null, null, -1, path.replace('\\', '/'), null, null).normalize().toASCIIString();
	} catch (final URISyntaxException ex) {
		LOG.warn("Failed to parse path: " + path, ex);
		return path;
	}
}
</pre>
</div></div>

<p>A new <tt>configuration.getpathProeprty(key)</tt> is added to simplify the use of this method.</p>

